  "notes": "Component eiis code CHU/system VI taken from block 13 per FORM-366 fields; narrative brackets [VI:CHU] confirm this pairing for the chillers. Isolation valve itself given no eiis code (none stated in narrative). Both Division I chillers (CHL1A, CHL1C) were rendered inoperable by the closed valve; CHL1C modeled implicitly via consequence text but not separately failed since narrative doesn't describe a distinct failure mode for it beyond inoperability status shared with CHL1A. Previous occurrence LER key preserved exactly as stated (050/458-2020-001-00) per rule 9."
